     {
      "t": "p",
      "x": "[ DIAGRAM / MAP / IMAGE PLACEHOLDER ]Title: Photographs Illustrating Joking Relationships & Social InteractionsDescription: Images showing traditional elders, community members on bicycles, and people sharing laughter to demonstrate Dankuuto and peace-building ."
     }
