       "“Futampaf” is a unifying force (it unites the jolas) .",
       "ROOTS OF HOMECOMING FESTIVAL: In the Gambia, the roots of home coming festival is an annual international cultural show that attracts many African origins across the globe (diaspora) to come to the Gambia and find their roots, at Juffureh the ancestral home of Alex Haley who is the 7th generation of Kunta Kinteh. Alex Haley wrote the book/film entitled ROOTS, in 1977 about the Atlantic slave trade ."
