      "t": "p",
      "x": "Dowry can be defined as the bride price paid in cash or kind by the prospective husband to the prospective wife. Traditionally, some dowry prices are Cattle, tobacco, big calabash etc. Dowry can also be a property or money brought by the wife to the husband’s house e.g. cooking utensils clothes etc ."
